Live stmt rail (hygiene re-read, `c_emit_println` depth):

```
let mut d = 0;
while sp < n {
    if LPAREN { d = d + 1 }
    else if RPAREN { if d <= 0 { break }; d = d - 1 }
    else if COMMA || SEMI { if d <= 0 { break } }
    if IDENT && __sec__sn == "1" { refuse }
}
```

Live check walker (hygiene re-read, `check_secret_println_sinks`):

```
let mut depth = 1;
while in_args && p < n {
    if LPAREN { depth = depth + 1 }
    else if RPAREN { depth = depth - 1; if depth <= 0 { close } }
    else if IDENT { c_secret_refuse_sink_resolved(...) }
}
```

